  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facility for Infrastructure Development (ORIO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Facility for Infrastructure Development (ORIO) encourages public infrastructure development in upcoming markets and developing countries. ORIO contributes to the development, construction, expansion, operation and maintenance of public infrastructure in these countries. In this way, ORIO aims to contribute to human development and private sector development. It is untied aid. Netherlands Enterprise Agency administers ORIO at the request of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of The Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
